    "plot": "Professor Quentin Quark's experimental Grand Unified Theory projector has misfired, trapping the Physics Department inside a localized Big Bounce bubble. His consciousness has split into thematic holographic projections across the campus, each governing a distorted domain of physics. As Alex Novak, a first-year student caught in the anomaly, you must explore twelve warped university locations, decipher physical constants and riddles, collect six Paradigm Badges, and finally reach the Observatory Apex to synthesize the Grand Unified Theory and stabilize spacetime before local entropy reaches critical collapse.",
    "rules": "1. Combat is disabled; challenges are resolved through scientific deduction, riddles, item combinations, and switch manipulation.\n2. The Quark-o-Meter tracks anomalous readings and local entropy.\n3. Each wing of the university exhibits warped laws of Quantum Mechanics, Relativity, Thermodynamics, Standard Model Particle Physics, Mass, or Gravity.\n4. At the Observatory Apex, the GUT Stabilizer cannot restore spacetime until Alex has collected all six Paradigm Badges. Its crafting recipe remains unchanged, but crafting it alone does not permit victory. The Entropy Badge may be skipped during Chapter 2, but Alex must return to collect it before final activation. This requirement takes precedence over any restoration sequence that checks only for the GUT Stabilizer; if any badge remains uncollected, activation fails without consuming the Stabilizer, and exploration continues.",
    "intro_text": "The fluorescent lights of the Central Atrium flicker in a colour that shouldn't exist on the visible spectrum. Seconds ago, you were heading to your morning lecture; now, the marble floor ripples like liquid mercury, and chunks of the ceiling drift lazily in mid-air. In the centre of the hall, a stuttering, translucent projection of Professor Quentin Quark glitches between three different outfits at once.\n\n'Ah, Novak! Punctual as a pulsar!' the hologram crackles, his voice echoing from yesterday and tomorrow simultaneously. 'Slight miscalculation with the Grand Unified Theory resonator! My mind has been refracted across the faculty wings, and local entropy is climbing fast. Take your Quark-o-Meter, gather the Paradigm Badges from my sub-personas, and meet me at the Observatory Apex before the campus compresses into a sub-planckian marble!'",
    "completed_condition": "",
    "gameover_condition": "",
    "completed_guard_expression": "tw.player.has_item('GUT_STABILIZER') and tw.vars.get('spacetime_restored') == True",
    "gameover_guard_expression": "tw.vars.get('entropy_level', 0) >= 100",
