  "quests": [],
  "awards": [],
  "sequences": [
    {
      "id": "SEQ_1_QUANTUM_RELATIVITY",
      "order": 1,
      "title": "Chapter 1: Superposition and Spacetime",
      "description": "Alex awakens in the Central Atrium and must explore the Schrodinger Cafeteria and Relativistic Library to solve the initial physics riddles, collect the Quantum and Relativity Badges, and obtain the Library Keycard.",
      "walkthrough": "1. In the CENTRAL_ATRIUM, read the ##CAMPUS_MAP_NOTE to learn the campus layout.\n2. Enter the SCHRODINGER_CAFETERIA and read the ##CAFETERIA_MENU_BOARD. It gives a 3-digit riddle: qubit states (2), Cartesian axes (3), first digit of Planck's constant (6) -> code '236'.\n3. Unlock the ##LUNCH_CRATE with code '236' and take ##BADGE_QUANTUM (and optional ##APPLE_JUICE_BOX).\n4. Return to CENTRAL_ATRIUM and enter RELATIVISTIC_LIBRARY. Read ##TIMEKEEPERS_SIGN and ##RELATIVITY_BOOKMARK: 4 grandfather clocks * 100 + 29 (first two digits of c) = '429'.\n5. Unlock ##RELATIVISTIC_BOOK_VAULT with code '429' and pick up ##LIBRARY_KEYCARD and ##BADGE_RELATIVITY.",
      "end_condition": "",
      "required_item_id": "LIBRARY_KEYCARD",
      "required_scene_id": "",
      "required_defeated_npc_id": "",
      "guard_expression": "tw.player.has_item('BADGE_QUANTUM') and tw.player.has_item('LIBRARY_KEYCARD')",
      "completion_guard_expression": "tw.player.has_item('BADGE_QUANTUM') and tw.player.has_item('LIBRARY_KEYCARD')",
      "exp_reward": 100,
      "on_start_sequence_script": "",
      "on_start_sequence_text": "",
      "on_end_sequence_script": "",
      "on_end_sequence_text": "With the Quantum Badge and High-Energy Lab Keycard in hand, the security turnstile in the Atrium awaits!"
    },
    {
      "id": "SEQ_2_PARTICLES_AND_ENTROPY",
      "order": 2,
      "title": "Chapter 2: Leptons and the Second Law",
      "description": "Use the Library Keycard to enter the Particle Lab, unlock the Standard Model Containment Cabinet for the Thermal Gloves, and brave the Entropy Archive and Dark Matter Boiler Room.",
      "walkthrough": "1. In CENTRAL_ATRIUM, unlock the exit to PARTICLE_LAB using ##LIBRARY_KEYCARD.\n2. Talk to ELECTRON_EE in PARTICLE_LAB, who mentions belonging to the 'LEPTON' family.\n3. Unlock ##PARTICLE_CABINET with password 'lepton' and collect ##BADGE_STANDARD_MODEL, ##CHARGED_COIL, and ##THERMAL_GLOVES.\n4. Head to RELATIVISTIC_LIBRARY and descend to ENTROPY_ARCHIVE. Read ##ENTROPY_AUDIT_MEMO for prefix '27' and speak with MADAM_ENTROPY (or HOLOGRAM_QUARK_THERMO) for suffix '73' -> code '2773'.\n5. (Optional) Unlock ##ENTROPY_STRONGBOX with '2773' to get ##BADGE_ENTROPY.\n6. Unlock the hatch from ENTROPY_ARCHIVE to DARK_MATTER_BOILER_ROOM using ##THERMAL_GLOVES.\n7. Talk to HIGGS_BOSON in DARK_MATTER_BOILER_ROOM to learn the four-letter answer 'mass'. Unlock ##MAINTENANCE_CAGE with code 'mass' and take ##DENSE_WRENCH, ##MASS_KEY, and ##BADGE_MASS.",
      "end_condition": "",
      "required_item_id": "DENSE_WRENCH",
      "required_scene_id": "",
      "required_defeated_npc_id": "",
      "guard_expression": "tw.player.has_item('DENSE_WRENCH') and tw.player.has_item('MASS_KEY')",
      "completion_guard_expression": "tw.player.has_item('DENSE_WRENCH') and tw.player.has_item('MASS_KEY')",
      "exp_reward": 150,
      "on_start_sequence_script": "",
      "on_start_sequence_text": "",
      "on_end_sequence_script": "",
      "on_end_sequence_text": "Equipped with the Dense Wrench and Graviton Brass Key, you are ready to conquer the Gravity Stairwell!"
    },
    {
      "id": "SEQ_3_GRAVITY_AND_CHRONOS",
      "order": 3,
      "title": "Chapter 3: Inverting the Vector",
      "description": "Unlock the Groundskeeper's Nebula Chest in the Cosmic Greenhouse, invert gravity in the Stairwell, piece together the split code for the Temporal Observatory, and unlock the Chronometric Safe.",
      "walkthrough": "1. Go from CENTRAL_ATRIUM to GRAVITY_STAIRWELL, then enter COSMIC_GARDEN.\n2. Unlock ##GROUNDSKEEPER_CHEST using ##MASS_KEY and collect ##BADGE_GRAVITY, ##STAR_SEEDS, and ##GARDEN_PLAQUE (which reveals the second half of the skybridge code: '06').\n3. Enter DEANS_OFFICE from GRAVITY_STAIRWELL and read ##DEANS_JOURNAL to find the first half of the skybridge code ('34'), forming '3406' (also solvable via the math riddle on the door).\n4. In GRAVITY_STAIRWELL, operate ##WALL_VECTOR_SWITCH to state 'INVERTED' (requires ##DENSE_WRENCH in inventory). This unlocks the ceiling exit to OBSERVATION_WALKWAY.\n5. Ascend to OBSERVATION_WALKWAY and unlock the exit to TEMPORAL_OBSERVATORY with code '3406'.\n6. In TEMPORAL_OBSERVATORY, unlock ##TEMPORAL_SAFE with the riddle answer 'time' and take ##TEMPORAL_KEYCARD.",
      "end_condition": "",
      "required_item_id": "TEMPORAL_KEYCARD",
      "required_scene_id": "TEMPORAL_OBSERVATORY",
      "required_defeated_npc_id": "",
      "guard_expression": "tw.player.has_item('TEMPORAL_KEYCARD')",
      "completion_guard_expression": "tw.player.has_item('TEMPORAL_KEYCARD')",
