      "title": "Chapter 4: The Grand Unified Theory",
      "description": "Combine the Quantum Paradigm Badge, Gravity Paradigm Badge, and Protostar Seeds into the Grand Unified Theory Stabilizer, then ascend to the Observatory Apex to restore Professor Quark and spacetime.",
      "walkthrough": "1. Combine ##BADGE_QUANTUM, ##BADGE_GRAVITY, and ##STAR_SEEDS to craft the CONSTRUCTABLE item ##GUT_STABILIZER (auto-revealed into the scene/inventory; pick it up if revealed in scene).\n2. Unlock the exit from TEMPORAL_OBSERVATORY to OBSERVATORY_APEX using ##TEMPORAL_KEYCARD.\n3. Enter OBSERVATORY_APEX while holding ##GUT_STABILIZER to trigger the resonator restoration script and win the adventure!",
